sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Harness Specs Engine
  participant E as Engineer Agent
  participant G as Restricted Git Provider
  participant L as Mission Ledger
  H->>E: Specs Maintenance Order
  E->>E: update allowed specs paths
  E->>H: candidate + source event mapping
  H->>H: links/schema/traceability validation
  H->>G: commit approved change-set
  alt no git
    G->>G: git init -b main
  end
  G->>G: verify local main; no network; no history rewrite
  G->>G: add allowlisted paths; commit
  G-->>H: commit/tree/diff receipt
  H->>L: specs/commit-recorded
